WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
In Genesis, God creates
humans male and female,

2
00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:07.450
and blesses them: be fruitful, multiply.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.460
In the next chapter, the
man and woman are naked,

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.440
and they are not ashamed.

5
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.510
Many religions see sexuality
as a gift with a purpose.

6
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.460
So why do many of them say
sex belongs only in marriage?

7
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:24.440
In this mission, you'll unpack
three words from Catholic teaching:

8
00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.580
marital, unitive and procreative.

9
00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:32.040
Then you will compare Christian and
non-religious views on sex before marriage,

10
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.880
and weigh up the arguments.

11
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:38.370
Your mission: find out why many
religions link sex to marriage,

12
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.050
and where others disagree.
